        "TileImage": "$($repository 3b964eaf-fde2-41d9-9211-af8e16f25a56).Image",
        "Description": "47,\rYour next targets have managed to get dirt on our client. Inconveniently, they are being monitored by heavy security that I recommend you disarm.\rLuckily, the only people that seem to know about our client are Sister Lei and a guard she has contacted called Virgilio Nelms.\rWe can not let the truth come out or it will hurt our reputation.\r\rI also wanted to let you know that we have found our client to be suspiciously powerful. I&apos;ll keep you updated on our investigation.\rGood luck.",
